### 결제 API 테스트

### 결제 요청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451"
}

### 결제 콜백 (성공) - PG에서 호출
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "TXN-001",
  "orderId": "1",
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "amount": 50000,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451",
  "createdAt": "2024-03-20T10:00:00+09:00",
  "updatedAt": "2024-03-20T10:00:01+09:00",
  "failureReason": null
}

### 결제 콜백 (실패) - PG에서 호출
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "TXN-002",
  "orderId": "2",
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "amount": 50000,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451",
  "createdAt": "2024-03-20T10:00:00+09:00",
  "updatedAt": "2024-03-20T10:00:01+09:00",
  "failureReason": "잔액 부족"
}

### 결제 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/1

### 주문으로 결제 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/orders/1

###
### 결제 상태 동기화 API
###

### 단건 결제 상태 동기화 (paymentId로)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/1/sync
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123

### 주문으로 결제 상태 동기화 (orderId로)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/orders/1/sync
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123

### 모든 PENDING 상태 결제 동기화 (관리자용 배치)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/sync-all
